            "label": "%manageBooks_openMenuItem%",
            "hiddenInterfaceModes": ["simple"],
            "localizeNotes": "Scripture editor top menu > Project > Manage books… (opens Manage Books targeting the editor's active project; the reserved platform.manageBooks default group places it in the Project section). Hidden in Simple mode: book management is a Power-mode task there, and the Simple book-not-available message tells the user to ask their project administrator — leaving the item visible would contradict that advice in the very same tab. Same gate the sibling comments item uses",
